Z||000002||cadaver||08-27-2001||01:27 AM||||So lets se you have an 86GT so you have backlit guages. And you probably got a cheap set of white stick ons. They are not made for backlit or through the guage lighting. They are made for reflective lighting like on nonGT/SE cars.||||reg||1
